OL,3,GNEWSAFlash-floods damage Lancaster
OL,4,Ahomes and businesses
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire County Council said anyone
OL,7,Faffected by flooding should report it
OL,8,Fto them via the website and it would
OL,9,Fuse any given information to help
OL,10,Finform "subsequent investigations".
